      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DEWANA MISSILE (2) jumped from out wide and was game in defeat last start when a 0.6 lengths second (30.23) behind O'keefe at this track. Nicely placed to grab a well-deserved win. KIWI EVOCA (7) is yet to miss the placings in an excellent record this trip which boasts three wins. Recorded a 2.25 lengths win (29.60) in a Mix 6/7 last time at Sandown. With even luck and a clean start should be around the money. ASSASSINATOR (1) has been a little hard to follow, missing the frame last time but was a Grade 5 winner three starts ago and has drawn 1 where he has won before. Well placed here and can atone this time. LAKEVIEW LYNETTE (8) has strong claims after a top-three finish when at the top of markets last time out.",
